### 通知微服务接口测试文件
### 基础URL: http://localhost:8083

### 1. 获取用户通知列表
GET http://localhost:8083/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 获取用户分页通知
GET http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/paged?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. 获取未读通知数量
GET http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/unread
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. 标记通知为已读
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. 标记所有通知为已读
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. 根据ID获取通知
GET http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/1
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. 获取特定类型的通知
GET http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/type/HOMEWORK
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. 获取特定课程的通知
GET http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/course/123
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. 获取特定班级的通知
GET http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/class/456
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. 搜索通知
GET http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/search?keyword=作业
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. 获取通知统计信息
GET http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/stats
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 12. 发送系统通知
POST http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/system
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "系统维护通知",
    "message": "系统将于今晚22:00-24:00进行维护升级，请提前保存工作内容。",
    "userIds": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
}

### 13. 发送课程通知
POST http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/course
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "课程时间调整通知",
    "message": "下周三的数据库课程时间调整为14:00-16:00，地点不变。",
    "courseId": 123,
    "userIds": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
}

### 14. 发送班级通知
POST http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/class
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "班级活动通知",
    "message": "本周五下午有班级聚会活动，地点：学校食堂，时间：18:00。",
    "classId": 456,
    "userIds": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
}

### 15. 删除通知
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/1
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 16. 清理过期通知
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/notifications/cleanup?daysToKeep=30
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

### 测试数据说明：
### - 用户ID: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (测试用户)
### - 课程ID: 123 (测试课程)
### - 班级ID: 456 (测试班级)
### - 通知ID: 1 (测试通知)

### 使用说明：
### 1. 将 {your_token} 替换为实际的认证令牌
### 2. 根据实际情况调整用户ID、课程ID、班级ID等参数
### 3. 可以使用IntelliJ IDEA、VS Code等IDE的HTTP客户端插件来执行这些请求
### 4. 或者使用Postman等API测试工具

